@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy — PaycheckCalculator</PageTitle>

<section class="calc-panel" style="max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="panel-header">
        <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="tab-content">
        <p>PaycheckCalculator stores your data locally by default. In the Blazor web app, anonymous data is kept only for your current browser session.</p>
        <p>If you create an account, your synced paychecks and budgets are stored on the sync server so data can merge across devices.</p>
        <p>You can export account data as JSON, delete local data, or permanently delete your account and synced data from the Account section.</p>
    </div>
</section>
